WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.313
Four dimensional disc embedding fails.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.664
Every algebraic test for disjoint discs passes here,

3
00:00:05.664 --> 00:00:08.083
yet no disjoint discs exist at all.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.658
A new invariant shows the pieces of any filling cannot fit together.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.220
Claimed: the free group is not good.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.644
Not in Lean.
